sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-repro-package> .

