        rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern & conical tail spot-to-ring transition — Reproducibility package: 92/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Deterministic RNG (`seed=1981`), 8-check `--self-test` suite (L653-681) verifying SHA-256 locks, JSON parity, substrate-inhibition threshold K*u0^2>1, conical tail mode exclusion, PDE spot-to-ring suppression, dual negative controls, specimen segmentation, and bitwise two-run determinism, plus self-contained 8-panel PNG and 6-frame animated GIF outputs." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
